# DC_Net_Hebbian_Model is brought in as a self-contained subfolder and keeps
# its own tracked RESULT logs + named reusable checkpoints (small, intentional -
# see DC_Net_Hebbian_Model/checkpoints/README.md). Un-ignore them here since the
# blanket RESULT/ and *.pt rules above would otherwise also match inside it.
!/DC_Net_Hebbian_Model/RESULT/
!/DC_Net_Hebbian_Model/RESULT/**
!/DC_Net_Hebbian_Model/checkpoints/*.pt
